class=\"w-full py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 xl:py-40 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#80808012_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#80808012_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:2rem_2rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1920px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl xl:max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16 sm:mb-20 lg:mb-24\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight\">Everything you need to run your business</h2><p class=\"mt-4 sm:mt-6 lg:mt-8 text-lg sm:text-xl xl:text-2xl text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed\">Modules designed specifically for modern retail and supermarket operations.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8 xl:gap-10\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 group h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"h-14 w-14 sm:h-16 sm:w-16 lg:h-20 lg:w-20 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 sm:mb-8 lg:mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-store h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 lg:h-10 lg:w-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5\"></path><path d=\"M17.774 10.31a1.12 1.12 0 0 0-1.549 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.451 0 1.12 1.12 0 0 0-1.548 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.452 0 1.12 1.12 0 0 0-1.549 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.77-3.248l2.889-4.184A2 2 0 0 1 7 2h10a2 2 0 0 1 1.653.873l2.895 4.192a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.774 3.244\"></path><path d=\"M4 10.95V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8.05\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4\">Point of Sale</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed flex-1\">Fast, offline-capable terminal. Handle suspended sales, cash-ups, integrated M-Pesa, card payments, and receipt printing seamlessly.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 group h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"h-14 w-14 sm:h-16 sm:w-16 lg:h-20 lg:w-20 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 sm:mb-8 lg:mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-cart h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 lg:h-10 lg:w-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m2.05 2.05 1.099-.028a1 1 0 0 1 1.008.815l2.69 14.347A1 1 0 0 0 7.83 18H18\"></path><path d=\"M4.563 5h16.435a1 1 0 0 1 .981 1.204l-1.026 6.226A2 2 0 0 1 18.962 14H6.25\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4\">Inventory &amp; Procurement</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed flex-1\">Real-time stock syncing across multiple branches. Automate purchase orders, manage suppliers, and track minimum stock thresholds.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-900/5 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all duration-300 group h-full flex flex-col md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><div class=\"h-14 w-14 sm:h-16 sm:w-16 lg:h-20 lg:w-20 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 sm:mb-8 lg:mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column lucide-bar-chart-3 h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8 lg:h-10 lg:w-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4\">AI Analytics &amp; Reports</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed flex-1\">Make data-driven decisions. Get deep insights into category performance, cashier shifts, and net profit margins instantly.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"w-full py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 xl:py-40 bg-blue-950 text-white relative border-t border-blue-900\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-[1920px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl xl:max-w-none\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-black mb-6 lg:mb-8 tracking-tight leading-tight text-white\">Ready to upgrade your retail experience?</h2><p class=\"text-blue-200 text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl mb-8 lg:mb-12 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Whether you run a single shop or a multi-branch supermarket network, SokoPoint-POS scales with you. Book a live demo today to see the OS in action.</p><div class=\"space-y-6 sm:space-y-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center